"P426281158" "Everything we stole from Portal Corp is in the tech-geeks' hands now, which leaves us with some time to wrap-up some loose ends. Much as I would like to settle differences between us, there's more important work to do. For instance, during the raid, one of our bases fell out of contact. It might be nothing, but it might be a hero operation, too. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Your job is to check it out and confront the base commander there about it.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2094611126" "Check out silent Arachnos base"
// SendOffString :
"P3747189237" "The main thing is to find the base commander. And if they've gone rogue or something, take 'em out."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3274678654" "Investigate Arachnos Base"

