// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4105635453" "The scientists looked at those floating rocks you found. They did come from the Shadow Shard after all. And we've intercepted reports from the heroes of Nemesis Army forces gathering out there. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Lord Recluse wants this investigated, and he wants you for the job.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2145456238" "Investigate Nemesis Army build-up in the Shadow Shard"
// SendOffString :
"P1518469263" "We got a portal conduit set up for you. It's over on Nerva, so you'll have to move some. Now, Nemesis does a lot of weird things, so a build-up of forces isn't too unusual. What we need to know is if this build-up is gonna come down on top of us. Try to find some records or something. Oh, and avoid fighting if you can. I mean, I don't care if you demolish the whole place, I understand that covert actions may not suit people like us. But you don't have to defeat anything in particular to get through this. We just need information."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P165249368" "Search Nemesis Army Base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2266242971" "Get back out there and find that information. We need to know if the Nemesis Army is gonna attack!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4032518458" "The initial sense of dislocation you feel upon entering the Shadow shard is now modified by the disconcerting sound of Nemesis Army drills."

