// Dialog :
"P2320040628" "You hit gold, but it ain't good news. These plans are for a huge operation. We're only gonna have one chance to stop the Nemesis Army before they get a foothold on Grandville itself!"
// RandomFameString :
"P2129641217" "I heard a rumor that the Nemesis Army is gonna attack! Will anything be able to stop them?"

