// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2794266656" "From the plan you found, we figured out the Nemesis Army plan of attack. But there ain't any time! The attack's gonna happen at any minute, and if they get a foothold, they might be able to take part of the island. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We're marshalling everybody! You gotta get down to the beaches!</A> I'll see you there myself!"
// AcceptString :
"P2952716405" "Stop the Nemesis Army invasion on the beach."
// SendOffString :
"P1197529064" "C'mon! There ain't much time! Get to the rally point there, and I'll meet you on the beach! They're tunnelling up from underground!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3379103921" "Stop Nemesis Attack!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2009999680" "Get back in there!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3850315288" "The full fury of the Nemesis army is about to be unleashed on top of you. Let them come!"

