// Dialog :
"P2353056833" "You did it! The Nemesis Army are slinking back to wherever they came from! You held 'em off and beat their machines! We may have had some tough times in the past, {VillainName}, but you've made good as far as I'm concerned. Now, we can turn all our efforts to Operation: DESTINY. And you're gonna have a big part in that, pal. A really big part."
// RandomFameString :
"P4010413578" "{VillainName} defeated the Nemesis Army! We're safe! Long live Lord Recluse! Long live {VillainName}!"

